-# app — see the assignment brief section for this module.
+# M5 — Unified Streamlit Dashboard and Decision-Support Interface
+
+Module 5 integrates Modules 1–4 into a single-page Streamlit web application for schedule inspection, constraint verification, bounded re-solving, and vector fatigue analysis.
+
+## Reproduce
+
+From the repository root with Python 3.12 and `requirements.txt` installed:
+
+```sh
+python run_all.py --seed "$(cat data/seed.txt)" --stage m5
+python -m pytest app/tests -q
+python -m streamlit run app/app.py
+```
+
+## Architecture
+
+| File | Role |
+| --- | --- |
+| `data_context.py` | Seeded `Instance` loading, `full`/`subset`/`toy` slicing, and CSV upload validation |
+| `m1_section.py` | CNF satisfiability check, minimal UNSAT core extraction, and Logic-to-0/1-ILP bridge |
+| `m2_section.py` | Precomputed/uploaded/live CBC schedule evaluation, Baseline comparison, and weekly filters |
+| `m3_section.py` | `{M, A, N, -}` trace encoding, `R1`–`R3` and minimal product DFA checks, and `add_rules_to_m2` |
+| `m4_section.py` | Direction B `(a, b, r)` calibration, 52-week spread/variance curves, and perturbation decay |
+| `precompute.py` | Deterministic cross-module summary check invoked by `run_all.py --stage m5` |
+| `app.py` | Unified single-page layout auto-loading the default dataset on startup |
